Value TOTAL_PREFIXES (\d+)
Value ACTIVE_PREFIXES (\d+)
Value PROTO (\S+)
Value TOTAL (\d+)
Value ACTIVE (\d+)
Value ADDED (\d+)
Value DELETED (\d+)

Start
  ^\s*Total\s+prefixes:\s+${TOTAL_PREFIXES}\s+Active\s+prefixes:\s+${ACTIVE_PREFIXES}\s*$$
  ^\s*Proto\s+Routes\s+Active\s+Added\s+Deleted\s*$$
  ^\s*${PROTO}\s+${TOTAL}\s+${ACTIVE}\s+${ADDED}\s+${DELETED}\s*$$ -> Record
  ^\s*-+$$
  ^\s*$$
